  "changes": [
    "Macro mode's source imported unchanged from toonst/digi_macro at bc2295e: the eleven files under src/, its LICENSE and its README (as upstream/README.md).",
    "Since ac5c237, digi_macro keeps the firmware locations in src/mm_os.h (the manifest passes only the device define) and the loop flag as a pragma in mm.h, so build.json passes only -DMM_DT2 and -DMM_FEATURE_KITS; and it includes core-dt2 1.1's header as elekloader#221 now names it, digitakt-mk2/core.h. With m68k-linux-gnu GCC 13.3 every Digitakt II object's text, disassembly and relocations are identical to ac5c237's.",
    "build.json is written from upstream's mods/dt2/mod.json and mods/dt2/kits.json: the same sources, subscriptions, contributions and claims. It has no stock sites: everything the module hooks is core 1.1's."
  ],
